How long has it been since you started playing? Perhaps now it is time to take a break?
Yes, it is time to return to the real world! Remember now that you are only looking at a screen.
How have your hands rested on the controls? Is your posture relaxed to any direction?
 How does your back feel? Your scalp? Your toes? Your gut? Your Legs?
What does the air smell like where you are?
Take a moment to look around you, at the color of the walls of the room you are in. Touch the wall. Take in any details of other furniture or decorum.
Better yet, I shall take this time to let you pause and leave for a short while. You may even converse with anyone not currently playing the came with you.
Come back whenever you like!
